<!doctype html><html lang="en-NZ"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><meta name="admin-user-key" content="<%= typeof adminUserKey !== 'undefined' ? adminUserKey : 'unknown' %>"><meta name="admin-session-minutes" content="<%= typeof adminSessionMinutes !== 'undefined' ? adminSessionMinutes : 45 %>"><meta name="theme-color" content="#004165"><title>Maintenance Mode | Avon Toastmasters</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/admin.css"><script src="/admin-session.js" defer></script></head><body class="admin-body"><main class="admin-shell"><header class="admin-topbar"><a class="admin-brand" href="/admin"><span class="admin-brand__mark">AVON</span><span><strong>TOASTMASTERS</strong><small>WEBSITE ADMINISTRATION</small></span></a><nav class="admin-nav"><a href="/admin">Dashboard</a><a href="/admin/announcements">Announcements</a><a href="/admin/events">Events</a><a href="/admin/media">Media</a><a href="/admin/users">Users</a><a href="/admin/settings">Security</a><a href="/admin/maintenance">Maintenance</a><a href="/admin/account">My account</a></nav><div class="admin-topbar__right"><span class="admin-user">Signed in as <strong><%= username %></strong></span><form method="post" action="/admin/logout"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="admin-logout" type="submit">Log out</button></form></div></header><section class="admin-heading"><p class="admin-eyebrow">WEBSITE MANAGEMENT</p><h1>Maintenance mode</h1><p class="admin-muted">Temporarily show visitors a maintenance page while signed-in administrators continue to use the live website.</p></section><% if(saved){ %><p class="admin-alert admin-alert--success" role="status">Maintenance settings saved successfully.</p><% } %><% if(error){ %><p class="admin-alert admin-alert--error" role="alert"><%= error %></p><% } %><section class="admin-card admin-narrow-card"><div class="admin-card__heading"><div><h2>Website availability</h2><p>Current status: <strong><%= status==='active'?'Maintenance active':status==='scheduled'?'Maintenance scheduled':status==='ended'?'Schedule ended':'Website online' %></strong></p></div><span class="admin-lock"><%= status==='active'?'PUBLIC 503':status==='scheduled'?'SCHEDULED':'ONLINE' %></span></div><form method="post" action="/admin/maintenance" class="admin-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label class="admin-toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" <%= maintenance.enabled?'checked':'' %>><span><strong>Enable maintenance mode</strong><small>When enabled and within the schedule, public visitors see the maintenance page. Authenticated administrators can browse the normal live website.</small></span></label><label for="title">Maintenance page heading</label><input id="title" name="title" maxlength="100" required value="<%= maintenance.title %>"><label for="message">Message for visitors</label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" maxlength="1000" required><%= maintenance.message %></textarea><small class="admin-help">Up to 1,000 characters. Your message is displayed as plain text.</small><label for="startAt">Start maintenance <span>(optional — blank means immediately)</span></label><input id="startAt" name="startAt" type="datetime-local" value="<%= startInput %>"><label for="endAt">Expected return / end time <span>(optional — blank means no automatic end)</span></label><input id="endAt" name="endAt" type="datetime-local" value="<%= endInput %>"><small class="admin-help">All times use New Zealand local time, including daylight saving. If an end time is set, maintenance mode automatically stops at that time. The setting remains saved so you can reuse or adjust it.</small><button class="admin-button" type="submit">Save maintenance settings →</button></form></section><section class="admin-tip"><strong>Administrator preview</strong><p>When maintenance is active, sign in to the admin panel and open the website normally. A yellow notice will confirm that you are viewing the live site while public visitors see the maintenance page. The admin panel and health checks remain available.</p></section><footer class="admin-page-footer"><a href="/admin">← Dashboard</a><a href="/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View live website ↗</a></footer></main></body></html>